%% title: Certifying an inventory
%% subtitle: The AI reads and reviews; code computes, hashes and decides; Hedera records each step in order.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Organization
  participant App as GreenTrace server
  participant AI as AI model
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant H as Hedera (HCS, HTS)
  participant I as IPFS

  U->>App: Upload bills (PDF or photo)
  App->>AI: Read quantities, units, periods, evidence
  AI-->>App: Schema-checked JSON
  App->>DB: Store reading, fingerprint, duplicate twins
  App->>H: AI_EXTRACTION hash
  U->>App: Review values, create inventory
  App->>DB: Recompute every line from the catalog
  U->>App: Run audit
  App->>App: 9 deterministic rules
  App->>AI: Review for plausibility
  AI-->>App: Extra findings only
  App->>H: AI_AUDIT hash
  alt risk is high
    App-->>U: Certification blocked, findings listed
  else low or medium risk
    App->>App: sha256(canonical inventory JSON)
    App->>I: Pin certificate metadata (CID)
    App->>H: Mint certificate NFT (metadata = ipfs://CID)
    App->>H: CERTIFICATE_ISSUED (hash, CID, serial)
    App-->>U: Certificate with public verification page
  end
